 d\, submissions are closed and decisions are due Jan 20\, 2027. The separ
 ate Journal-to-Conference poster track for already published journal pape
 rs (form\, Jan 18\, 2027 AoE) is not a fresh-paper route.\nScope: Researc
 h at the interface of artificial intelligence\, machine learning\, and st
 atistics. Its defining emphasis is on statistical foundations and methodo
 logy for learning and inference\, rather than a particular application do
 main. Research bridges statistical reasoning and learning algorithms\, wi
 th archival contributions to both communities.\nAdditional topics: \nScop
 e sources (2027): https://aistats.org/aistats2027/\, https://aistats.org/
